    "body": "@travisleithead, any thoughts on what to do with `productSub`, `vendor` and `vendorSub`?\n\nThe one thing that bugs me is that it's going to look entirely arbitrary which attributes are exposed and not. It's pretty likely that more of this legacy cruft could be hidden from workers, but the effort to measure that hardly seems worth it.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
