    "created_at": "2015-10-01T13:24:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-10-01T13:24:41Z",
    "body": "I've now also tested in Safari and it exposes `appName`, `appVersion`, `platform`, and `userAgent`, but does not expose `appCodeName`, `product`, `productSub`, `vendor` and `vendorSub`.\n\nAdding all of this up, it seems pretty likely that it's web-compatible not not expose `appCodeName`, `product`, `productSub`, `vendor` and `vendorSub` to workers, so how about trying that and changing only if it turns out that one of them is in fact needed?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
