    "body": "Oops, bad news. It's invalid per WebIDL to use `[Exposed=Window]` on a `NavigatorID` member, because `WorkerNavigator` has only `[Exposed=Worker]` and implements `NavigatorID`. The exposure set of a member must be a subset of the interface it's on.\n\nThis ought to be a problem for `taintEnabled()` as well.\n\nIdeas?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
