    "updated_at": "2015-10-05T07:59:08Z",
    "body": "Yeah, if this is valid per Web IDL I guess we could keep it the way it is. Closing again, but if anyone thinks it's too confusing like this or wants to lobby for Web IDL to make it invalid, just say the word.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
